uce, cherry tomatoes, olives, onion, pomegranate and mint, dusted with za’atar and sumac, finished with sesame oil and crisp lavash.","category":"Fresh Salads","price":550,"imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fgreek-hummus-cutout.webp?alt=media","photoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fgreek-hummus.webp?alt=media","ogImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fgreek-hummus-og.jpg?alt=media","available":true,"diet":"veg","allergens":["sesame","gluten"],"nutrition":null,"ingredients":["Hummus","Cucumber","Lettuce","Cherry tomatoes","Olives","Onion","Pomegranate","Mint","Za’atar","Sumac","Lavash","Sesame oil"]},{"id":"potato-apple","slug":"roasted-potato-apple-salad","name":"Roasted Potato & Apple Salad","description":"Herb-roasted potatoes, crisp apples, lettuce, cherry tomatoes and walnuts folded in a tangy French egg gribiche sauce with capers and gherkins.","category":"Fresh Salads","price":370,"imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple-cutout.webp?alt=media","photoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple.webp?alt=media","ogImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple-og.jpg?alt=media","available":true,"diet":"egg","allergens":["egg","tree nuts (walnut)","milk","mustard"],"nutrition":{"protein":8,"calories":270},"ingredients":["Roasted potatoes","Apples","Lettuce","Cherry tomatoes","Walnuts","French egg gribiche sauce","Capers","Gherkins","Herbs"]},{"id":"potato-apple-eggless","slug":"roasted-potato-apple-salad-eggless","name":"Roasted Potato & Apple Salad (Eggless)","description":"Herb-roasted potatoes, crisp apples, lettuce, cherry tomatoes and walnuts with a tangy eggless gribiche made on creamy hung curd, with gherkins and herbs.","category":"Fresh Salads","price":370,"imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple-cutout.webp?alt=media","photoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple.webp?alt=media","ogImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple-og.jpg?alt=media","available":true,"diet":"veg","allergens":["tree nuts (walnut)","milk","mustard"],"nutrition":null,"ingredients":["Roasted potatoes","Apples","Lettuce","Cherry tomatoes","Walnuts","Eggless hung curd gribiche sauce","Gherkins","Herbs"]},{"id":"chocolate-fruit-bowl","slug":"dark-chocolate-fruit-bowl","name":"Dark Chocolate Fruit Bowl","description":"Velvety hung curd blended with dark chocolate compound, cocoa, orange zest and honey, topped with seasonal exotic fruits and granola or nuts.","category":"Fruit & Dessert Bowls","price":370,"imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fchocolate-fruit-bowl-cutout.webp?alt=media","photoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fchocolate-fruit-bowl.webp?alt=media","ogImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fchocolate-fruit-bowl-og.jpg?alt=media","available":true,"diet":"veg","allergens":["milk","gluten (granola)","nuts (granola — check label)"],"nutrition":{"protein":9,"calories":400},"ingredients":["Hung curd","dark chocolate compound","cocoa","orange zest","honey","seasonal exotic fruits","granola/nuts"]}]},"children":"$L16"}]
17:T82a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://leafli.in/blog/low-calorie-food-delivery-in-vadodara#article","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://leafli.in/blog/low-calorie-food-delivery-in-vadodara"},"headline":"Low Calorie Food Delivery in Vadodara That Fills You Up","description":"How to choose low calorie food delivery in Vadodara that still fills you up: protein, fibre, portion size, dressings, and calorie labels you can trust.","image":["https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple.webp?alt=media"],"datePublished":"2026-10-25T15:53:18.158Z","dateModified":"2026-10-25T15:53:18.158Z","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Leafli Kitchen Team","description":"The chefs behind Leafli's bowls. We write every recipe down, weigh every portion and test what travels well — this blog shares what we've learned.","url":"https://leafli.in/about"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://leafli.in/#organization"},"articleSection":"Vadodara guides","keywords":"low calorie food delivery in Vadodara, meals under 500 calories, calorie counted meals Vadodara, diet food delivery, low calorie, weight loss, food delivery, Vadodara","wordCount":810,"inLanguage":"en-IN"},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a good calorie range for a lunch?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on your needs, but many adults trying to manage weight find lunches of about 400–600 calories with plenty of protein and vegetables work well. A dietitian can tailor this."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Leafli show calories for each dish?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every dish on the Leafli menu lists its calories, and many list protein too, along with ingredients and allergens."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are low-calorie meals always healthy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not necessarily. A meal can be low in calories but also low in protein and fibre, leaving you hungry. Look for balance, not just a low number."}}]}]}7:["$","main",null,{"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$17"}}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"bg-cream-100 pt-32 pb-12 md:pt-40","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8","children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://leafli.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://leafli.in/blog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Vadodara guides\",\"item\":\"https://leafli.in/blog/category/vadodara-guides\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Low Calorie Food Delivery in Vadodara: Meals That Still Fill You Up\",\"item\":\"https://leafli.in/blog/low-calorie-food-delivery-in-vadodara\"}]}]}"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-sm text-ink/50","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","li","/",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[false,["$","$L18",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-leaf-700","children":"Home"}]]}],["$","li","/blog",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"/"}],"$L19"]}],"$L1a","$L1b"]}]}]],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"]}],"$L23"]}]
